 "sentences": [
  "Satellites are now hunting autumn leaves from space.",
  "NASA’s PACE satellite tracks leaf pigments across the entire globe daily.",
  "It measures chlorophyll, carotenoids, and anthocyanins to map fall foliage changes.",
  "The data reveals exactly when and where forests turn vibrant shades of red and yellow.",
  "While poets once traveled to see these colors, we can now track them instantly from orbit."
